version: "2.2"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/abdallahyasser12/RedVenom-v2.2"
abstract: >-
  RedVenom is a Bash-based workflow that orchestrates established command-line
  tools for authorized web reconnaissance and exploratory security testing.
  It is an early-stage interactive prototype; its outputs require manual
  verification and do not establish that a target is secure.
keywords:
  - application security
  - web security testing
  - reconnaissance
  - security automation
